WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[No sound. A dry, faded meadow on rolling hills.]

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
[Green shoots spread. A nest box and a bee hotel appear.]

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
[Milkweed, black-eyed Susans and goldenrod bloom. A bluebird lands on the nest box.]

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:20.000
[Monarch butterflies and bumble bees come back to the flowers.]

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.400
[The view drifts along the path through the living meadow.]
